      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's incredibly vivid. You can really feel the tension in the room with Andre's entrance.\n\nSince I'm looking at the scenes through the lens of the medical staff, I want to explore how that \"electric charge\" from Andre actually changes how the doctors and nurses behave. With Sophie, it seems like they'd be more nurturing, but with Andre, would that unpredictability and intensity make them more guarded? Like, would they be more cautious about how they touch him or how they talk to him, just to keep the situation under control?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
